{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #2", "duration_min": 10.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>What is the value of 0.8  X  0.8  X  0.8 + 0.7  X  0.7  X  0.7 + 2.52?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>0.8 X 0.8 X 0.8 + 0.7 X 0.7 X 0.7 + 2.52 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["2.125", "5.165", "4.275", "3.375"], "options_hi": ["2.125", "5.165", "4.275", "3.375"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>0.8  X  0.8  X  0.8 + 0.7  X  0.7  X  0.7 + 2.52</p><p>= 0.8<sup>3</sup> + 0.7<sup>3</sup> + 3  X  0.8  X  0.7 (0.8 + 0.7)</p><p><b>We know that:</b> (a + b)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + 3ab (a + b)</p><p>= (0.8 + 0.7)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 1.5<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 3.375</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>0.8  X  0.8  X  0.8 + 0.7  X  0.7  X  0.7 + 2.52</p><p>= 0.8<sup>3</sup> + 0.7<sup>3</sup> + 3  X  0.8  X  0.7 (0.8 + 0.7)</p><p><b>We know that:</b> (a + b)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + 3ab (a + b)</p><p>= (0.8 + 0.7)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 1.5<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 3.375</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify the following expression.</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">7.35 x 7.35 - 2.25 x 2.25", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375;&#2404;</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">7.35 x 7.35 - 2.25 x 2.25", "options_en": ["204", "320", "225", "304"], "options_hi": ["204", "320", "225", "304"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=156 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23402/image058.png\"></p><p><img width=189 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23402/image059.png\"></p><p><img width=69 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23402/image060.png\"></p><p>= 40 * 5.1</p><p>= 204</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=156 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23402/image058.png\"></p><p><img width=189 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23402/image059.png\"></p><p><img width=69 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23402/image060.png\"></p><p>= 40 * 5.1</p><p>= 204</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The value of the expression (1.55<sup>2</sup> +0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55 &#1093; 0.55) is equal to:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; (1.55<sup>2</sup> +0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55 &#1093; 0.55) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["1.55<sup>2</sup>-0.55<sup>2</sup>", "1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup>", "1.55<sup>3</sup>+0.55<sup>3</sup>", "1.55<sup>2</sup>+0.55<sup>2</sup>"], "options_hi": ["1.55<sup>2</sup>-0.55<sup>2</sup>", "1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup>", "1.55<sup>3</sup> 0.55<sup>3</sup>", "1.55<sup>2</sup> 0.55<sup>2</sup>"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Formula of </p><p>a<sup>3</sup>-b<sup>3</sup>=(a-b)(a<sup>2</sup>+b<sup>2</sup> +ab)</p><p>let a=1.55 and b=0.55</p><p>so (1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup>)=(1.55-0.55)(1.55<sup>2</sup> + 0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55*0.55)</p><p>therefore</p><p>(1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup>)=(1.55<sup>2</sup> + 0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55*0.55)</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Formula of </p><p>a<sup>3</sup>-b<sup>3</sup>=(a-b)(a<sup>2</sup>+b<sup>2</sup> +ab)</p><p>let a=1.55 and b=0.55</p><p>so (1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup>)=(1.55-0.55)(1.55<sup>2</sup> + 0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55*0.55)</p><p>therefore</p><p>(1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup>)=(1.55<sup>2</sup> + 0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55*0.55)</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Arrange the following ratios in ascending order. </p><p>3:4, 3:5, 2:11, 7:2 </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2357;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>3:4, 3:5, 2:11, 7:2 </p>", "options_en": ["3:5 &lt; 2:11 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2", "7:2 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 2:11", "2:11 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2", "3:4 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 2:11 &lt; 7:2"], "options_hi": ["3:5 &lt; 2:11 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2", "7:2 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 2:11", "2:11 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2", "3:4 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 2:11 &lt; 7:2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>3:4 = 3/4 = 0.75 </p><p>3:5 = 3/5 = 0.6 </p><p>2:11 = 2/11 = 0.1818 </p><p>7:2 = 7/2 = 3.5</p><p>Ascending order: 0.1818 &lt; 0.6 &lt; 0.75 &lt; 3.5</p><p>So, 2:11 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>3:4 = 3/4 = 0.75 </p><p>3:5 = 3/5 = 0.6 </p><p>2:11 = 2/11 = 0.1818 </p><p>7:2 = 7/2 = 3.5</p><p>Ascending order: 0.1818 &lt; 0.6 &lt; 0.75 &lt; 3.5</p><p>So, 2:11 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What is the correct descending order of the following ratios? </p><p>17/30, 7/15, 27/50, 11/20 </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2309;&#2357;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>17/30, 7/15, 27/50, 11/20 </p>", "options_en": ["11/20 &gt; 17/30 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 7/15", "17/30 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 7/15", "17/30 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 7/15", "7/15 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 17/30"], "options_hi": ["11/20 > 17/30 > 27/50 > 7/15", "17/30 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 7/15", "17/30 > 27/50 > 11/20 > 7/15", "7/15 > 11/20 > 27/50 > 17/30"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Convert to decimals: </p><p>17/30 = 0.56</p><p>7/15 = 0.46</p><p>27/50 = 0.54</p><p>11/20 = 0.55</p><p>Order: 0.56 &gt; 0.55 &gt; 0.54 &gt; 0.46</p><p>= 17/30 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 7/15</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Convert to decimals: </p><p>17/30 = 0.56</p><p>7/15 = 0.46</p><p>27/50 = 0.54</p><p>11/20 = 0.55</p><p>Order: 0.56 &gt; 0.55 &gt; 0.54 &gt; 0.46</p><p>= 17/30 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 7/15</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Adi and Dia together have &#8377;1,440. If 3/10 of Adi's amount is equal to 3/5 of Dia's amount, how much amount does Dia have?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2310;&#2342;&#2367; &#2324;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2325;&#2352; &#8377;1,440 &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2310;&#2342;&#2367; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; 3/10 &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; 3/5 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["&#8377;480", "&#8377;540", "&#8377;464", "&#8377;512"], "options_hi": ["&#8377;480", "&#8377;540", "&#8377;464", "&#8377;512"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let Dia's amount = &#8377;n</p><p>Adi's amount = &#8377;(1440  -  n)</p><p>3/10 * (1440  -  n) = 3/5 * n</p><p>1440  -  n = 2n</p><p>3n = 1440</p><p>n = 480</p><p>Dia's amount = &#8377;480</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let Dia's amount = &#8377;n</p><p>Adi's amount = &#8377;(1440  -  n)</p><p>3/10 * (1440  -  n) = 3/5 * n</p><p>1440  -  n = 2n</p><p>3n = 1440</p><p>n = 480</p><p>Dia's amount = &#8377;480</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which is the greatest ratio among the following? </p><p>8/11,4/5,1/2 and 1/11</p>", "q_hi": "&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>8/11,4/5,1/2 &#2324;&#2352; 1/11", "options_en": ["4/5", "1/2", "1/11", "8/11"], "options_hi": ["4/5", "1/2", "1/11", "8/11"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>8/11 &#8776; 0.727, 4/5 = 0.8, 1/2 = 0.5, 1/11 &#8776; 0.091 </p><p>Greatest: 4/5.</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>8/11 &#8776; 0.727, 4/5 = 0.8, 1/2 = 0.5, 1/11 &#8776; 0.091 </p><p>Greatest: 4/5.</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>12.75% is equivalent to ___</p>", "q_hi": "12.75% ___ &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;", "options_en": ["37/400", "51/400", "41/400", "17/200"], "options_hi": ["37/400", "51/400", "41/400", "17/200"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>12.75% = 12.75 / 100 = 1275 / 10000 = 51 / 400 </p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>12.75% = 12.75 / 100 = 1275 / 10000 = 51 / 400 </p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following fractions is the largest?</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2", "options_en": ["2/3", "33/44", "6/53", "79/90"], "options_hi": ["2/3", "33/44", "6/53", "79/90"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>2/3 &#8776; 0.6667</p><p>6/53 &#8776; 0.1132</p><p>79/90 &#8776; 0.8778</p><p>33/44 &#8776; 3/4 or 0.75</p><p>79/90 or 0.8778 is the largest</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>2/3 &#8776; 0.6667</p><p>6/53 &#8776; 0.1132</p><p>79/90 &#8776; 0.8778</p><p>33/44 &#8776; 3/4 or 0.75</p><p>79/90 or 0.8778 is the largest</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A fraction 3/5 is decreased by 2/5. The resulting fraction is then increased by 20%. What is the percentage decrease/increase in the value of the original fraction?</p>", "q_hi": "&#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; 3/5 &#2325;&#2379; 2/5 &#2360;&#2375; &#2328;&#2335;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2339;&#2366;&#2350;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379; 20% &#2348;&#2338;&#2364;&#2366; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2361;&#2369;&#2312; &#2361;&#2376;?", "options_en": ["Increase, 60%", "Decrease, 50%", "Increase, 50%", "Decrease, 60%"], "options_hi": ["&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;, 60%", "&#2325;&#2350;&#2368;, 50%", "&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;, 50%", "&#2325;&#2350;&#2368;, 60%"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>&#8226; Original fraction = 3/5 = 0.6.</p><p>&#8226; Decrease by 2/5 = 0.4 =&gt; New fraction = 0.6  -  0.4 = 0.2.</p><p>&#8226; Increase this new fraction by 20% =&gt; 0.2  X  1.2 = 0.24.</p><p>&#8226; Compare final value (0.24) with original value (0.6).</p><p>&#8226; The drop is 0.6  -  0.24 = 0.36, which is 0.36/0.6 = 60% decrease.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>&#8226; Original fraction = 3/5 = 0.6.</p><p>&#8226; Decrease by 2/5 = 0.4 =&gt; New fraction = 0.6  -  0.4 = 0.2.</p><p>&#8226; Increase this new fraction by 20% =&gt; 0.2  X  1.2 = 0.24.</p><p>&#8226; Compare final value (0.24) with original value (0.6).</p><p>&#8226; The drop is 0.6  -  0.24 = 0.36, which is 0.36/0.6 = 60% decrease.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}